&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate brings a unique combination of strategic thinking, technical understanding, and execution capability. You&#39;re passionate about AI safety and Anthropic&#39;s mission to create AI systems that are helpful, harmless, and honest. You thrive in ambiguous environments and can navigate complex negotiations while maintaining strong relationships across multiple stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
