&lt;li&gt;Ability to navigate legal issues with a practical and commercially sensible mindset, balancing litigation risk against business and product realities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and oral communication skills, with the ability to tailor the message to the audience, whether engineers, executives, outside counsel, or government officials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple high-stakes workstreams simultaneously, prioritize effectively, and consistently deliver results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
