&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;Please note that 2K Publishing is unable to provide visa sponsorship or assistance for this position. All candidates must be legally authorized to work in United States without requiring current or future employer sponsorship.&lt;/p&gt;
